    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12573" root="دعج" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَعِجَ</span></b> , [aor. 
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَعَجَ</span></b> ,] inf. n. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَعَجٌ</span>, <i>He</i> (a man &amp;c.)
<i>was,</i> or <i>became, characterized by what is termed</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَعَجٌ</span> <i>as explained below.</i> (TA.) And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَعِجَتِ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">العَيْنُ</span> <i>The eye was,</i> or <i>became,</i> [<i>so characterized;</i>
or] <i>wide and black;</i> or <i>intensely black and intensely white.</i> (Msb.)

